  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Page printed rotated 90°; read from rotated crops. Rows: 14 as printed (1899–1911, with 1908 printed as two lines: the year's figures and a starred line, joined by braces). The starred line is row '1908 *', asterisks kept in the cells.",
   "1908: several cells are printed once, centred against the two lines (Enrolled — Female 80; Left — Died — Male 13; Index Number — Enrolled 3,937; Index Number — Left 1,473). They are placed on the first 1908 row and the starred row has \"\" there.",
   "Column heading 'Enrolled' printed twice (group and sub-heading); flattened once as 'Enrolled — Male' etc.",
   "Legible though partly broken: 1906 'Left — Total — Female' 16 (6 broken); 1911 'Index Number — Left' 2,242 (last 2 broken).",
   "Total checks (Enrolled M+F=Total; Left Total M+F=Total; Graduated+Left+Died = Left Total per sex), all rows incl. 1908 starred line: all reconcile."
  ],
